  "id": 713,
  "description": "🩸 🌑 NIGHTMARE GUILD 🌑 🩸\nIdle MMO Guild | Long-Term | No Pressure\n\nTired of being told how much you must donate?\n\nSick of guilds demanding X raids per day or X items per week?\n\nStep into the dark — Nightmare does things differently.\n\n🔥 What We Offer\n\n🛡️ Regular Guild Pools – Consistent benefits without guilt or pressure\n\n💀 Chill, Long-Term Community – Built for players who plan to stick around\n\n🧠 Play Your Way – No forced quotas, no micromanagement\n\n🩸 Donations That Matter – Give what you can, when you can\n\n🌑 Drama-Free Environment – Respect &gt; ego\n\n🕯️ Who We’re Looking For\n\n✔️ Active or semi-active long-term players\n\n✔️ Members who donate naturally and enjoy shared progress\n\n✔️ Players tired of sweaty rules and mandatory grind\n\n✔️ Anyone who wants a stable guild that won’t burn out\n\n🚫 What We Don’t Do\n\n❌ No mandatory donation amounts\n\n❌ No forced raid requirements\n\n❌ No kicking over missed days\n\n❌ No power-tripping leadership\n\nNightmare isn’t about fear.\nIt’s about freedom.\n\nIf you’re ready to escape toxic guild rules and actually enjoy Idle MMO again —\n🩸 Join Nightmare. 🩸\n\nhttps://discord.gg/ZjCXM9DnAC",
